--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: QuestResults_en-US
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en-US
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 08edffda23451f8419f80d25bb3887ad, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 22216802304
    m_Localized: ' Prince Frederick is found safe and sound atop the master suite''s
      ceiling fan. The Mayor tearfully embraces the feline, while Penelope assures
      everyone that ''there was no break-in, merely a technical inspection.'''
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22275522560
    m_Localized: After a night of failed searches, the Mayor appears with dark circles
      under his eyes, shredding papers in his office. Penelope denies that the cat
      was ever seen near confidential documents."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22279716864
    m_Localized: 'The hospital awakens in silence: patients are found sleeping comfortably
      on gurneys, while a mysterious ''wellness consultant'' receives praise from
      the medical staff. The Mayor publicly gives thanks for the swift response to
      the ''mild collective indisposition.'''
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22279716865
    m_Localized: 'Chaos at Holy Hope Hospital: bloodstains are found along the corridors,
      and witnesses report strange creatures fleeing into the night. City Hall denies
      any connection to the vaccination drive and announces an internal investigation.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22283911168
    m_Localized: Nightclub Fancy Balency wraps up the night with zero incidents.
      Partygoers report that a 'performance artist' wrapped an agitated customer
      in decorative banners, turning the whole thing into part of the show. The Mayor
      was spotted sleeping on a VIP couch, neatly bandaged like a party mummy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22283911169
    m_Localized: 'The night ends in chaos at Fancy Balency : an unidentified man
      danced on top of the bar counter, knocked over dozens of bottles, and demanded
      the DJ play ''my ex''s song.'' City Hall denies any involvement, claiming the
      politician was merely taking part in an ''unofficial cultural initiative.'''
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22283911170
    m_Localized: 'Central Bank Branch registers only a ''technical glitch'' this
      morning. Witnesses report that a gigantic, one-eyed man entered the vault,
      retrieved a briefcase, and escorted out a confused customer before the police
      arrived. The Mayor was later found sleeping at home, with a note in his pocket:
      ''Love cannot be paid in installments.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22283911171
    m_Localized: The Mayor was detained following an attempted bank robbery. In his
      statement, he claimed he was 'merely winning over a teller and planning his
      financial future.' City Hall reported that he was on an 'unauthorized social
      mission.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22283911172
    m_Localized: The delegate is escorted to the stage minutes before the presentation.
      He thanks the 'personal wellness consultant' and promises to cut his speech
      down to just three hours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22283911173
    m_Localized: Security kicks the door down, the delegate faints onto the slides,
      and the press discovers that the Global League for Human Peace left a guest
      forgotten in the hotel for six hours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22283911174
    m_Localized: The translation is fixed just in time. The delegates applaud the
      League's 'diplomatic courage,' completely unaware that they almost went to
      war over a software update error.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22283911175
    m_Localized: The World Peace Summit comes to an end after delegates storm out
      of the hall shouting in seven different languages. The League reports that
      'there was merely a difference of interpretation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22283911176
    m_Localized: The crowd calms down after hearing soothing voices coming from the
      broken speakers. The candles on the old stage light up on their own, and for
      a few minutes, the square feels like a safe place. The League expresses its
      gratitude to the 'collective wellness consultant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22283911177
    m_Localized: The crowd storms the League's headquarters, occupies the auditorium,
      and demands bread. Security attempts to intervene, only to trigger the biggest
      scandal of the World Peace Summit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22283911178
    m_Localized: The fire in the Lecture Hall is controlled before spreading. Delegates
      are safely evacuated, and the League announces that the eco-friendly kits will
      be 'rethought with more love for the planet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22283911179
    m_Localized: Fire spreads through the headquarters of the Global League for Human
      Peace. Delegates are hastily evacuated, and the press asks how an eco-friendly
      kit managed to cause more damage than a cold war.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21949966811136
    m_Localized: She travels to another country and orders a missile strike on the
      store
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21950017142784
    m_Localized: The manicurist manages to fix the nail and even launches a brand-new
      trend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21950017142785
    m_Localized: "Gl\xF3ria joins her husband, and they enjoy a relaxing moment filled
      with lots of gossip."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21950017142786
    m_Localized: "Seeing her husband's foot being completely sucked in, a horrified
      Gl\xF3ria divorces him right then and there."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21950017142787
    m_Localized: Baltazar loses his tie, but he had a spare one in his bag. He heads
      to his meeting happily.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21950017142788
    m_Localized: Baltazar loses his tie, his suit, and the contract, while the press
      covers his downfall as a 'contemporary art performance.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21950017142789
    m_Localized: The crown is successfully recovered, thoroughly washed, and handed
      back to the queen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21950017142790
    m_Localized: The crown is swept down the plumbing, the queen breaks down and
      declares a 'royal state of emergency,' while the airport is shut down for searches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21950017142791
    m_Localized: "Louro Jos\xE9 is captured and sent home via Uber Pet."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21950017142792
    m_Localized: The parrot squawks it all out on live TV, the senator lands under
      federal investigation, and the interview skyrockets to become the nation's
      top viral video.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21950017142793
    m_Localized: The bear feels threatened and leaves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21950017142794
    m_Localized: The bear takes over the bedroom, Mrs. Charlotte sleeps in the garden,
      and the family sues the agency for 'infringement of ursine privacy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34454197862400
    m_Localized: '

      The chimpanzees leave the senior living home after an unprecedented
      deal: they return to the zoo in exchange for weekly sunbathing sessions and
      a fruit buffet. The elderly ladies celebrate the return of peace and promise
      to send letters to their new furry friends.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34454256582656
    m_Localized: A senior living home is taken over by chimpanzees who refuse to
      leave. The residents are forced to live in the garden while the primates organize
      shifts for sunbathing, snacks, and meetings in the main hall. The zoo denies
      any responsibility.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34454256582657
    m_Localized: Candy Candy's Bread Festival ends on a celebratory note after all
      the bread is recovered from a secret base. The thieves were found trying to
      hide baguettes under the couch. The bakery is celebrating with a 20% discount
      on croissants.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34454256582658
    m_Localized: 'The Candy Candy Bread Festival gets called off after gluttonous
      thieves steal the whole batch. Eyewitnesses claim the crooks made their getaway
      laughing with their mouths full. The bakery vows to return for a second round,
      but begs for understanding: ''our oven is grieving.'''
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34454256582659
    m_Localized: The missing dancers have been retrieved alive and well from the
      city underground. They hit the club stages that very night, restoring music,
      glamour, and gloss to the nightlife scene. To celebrate, the venues are hosting
      an appreciation bash with free entry for anyone rocking stilettos.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34454256582660
    m_Localized: Local clubs are still down their dancers after sewer search parties
      come up dry. The sole lead remains a manhole surrounded by a tube of open gloss
      and stiletto marks. The city's night goes quiet, and DJs take to socials begging
      for backup.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34454256582661
    m_Localized: Mrs. Maria in apartment 841 finally gets her pickle jar open thanks
      to some emergency backup. She marks the victory with a late-night feast and
      vows never to underestimate the strength of a stubborn lid again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34454256582662
    m_Localized: The pickle jar holds the line heroically in the late-night darkness
      of apartment 841. Mrs. Maria throws in the towel after multiple tries and heads
      to bed hungry, while the jar sits completely untouched in the refrigerator.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34454256582663
    m_Localized: Mother and daughter reconcile after a discreet mediation. The diary
      goes back to its proper place, apologies are accepted, and the family group
      chat goes back to being strictly about recipes and chain letters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34454256582664
    m_Localized: A family feud erupts in the group chat after the diary is read.
      Gertrude disowns her daughter, the daughter fires back with a seven-minute
      voice message, and the grandmother calls for calm while changing the group
      name to 'Family Matters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 34454256582665
    m_Localized: Alissa is whisked away from the room without a scene and driven
      home by a 'family well-being advisor.' The principal drops the idea of calling
      the cops, and the daughter remains completely oblivious that the substitute
      teacher was her mom all along.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 82370509766656
    m_Localized: The cops show up before the agency and catch Alissa lecturing the
      room on 'the perils of trusting teens.' She gets hauled off yelling that her
      daughter needs closer watching, as the principal shuts down the class and asks
      for a transfer on the spot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 82370560098304
    m_Localized: Monster successfully recruited to your team!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 82370560098305
    m_Localized: The monster was so horrified by your proposal that it stormed off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
